@startuml class-diagram
title Structural class diagram — Charter Offering Service (DDD stereotypes; pure core vs edge rings; inward deps)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontColor #15202B
skinparam ArrowColor #30475E
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classBorderColor #30475E
skinparam classFontColor #15202B
skinparam noteBorderColor #8899A6
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F5F8FA
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #F5F8FA

package "kernel  «CORE shared kernel»" #EDF6FC {
  package "kernel.domain" #F2F9FD {
    class PackDescriptor <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
    class PackPaths <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
    class DoctrineGraph <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
    class CharterRefusal <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
    enum ArtifactKind <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
  }
  package "kernel.validation" #E4F1FA {
    class ModularRuleset <<DomainService>> #D8EBF7 {
      +guard(T) void
      +check(T) Evaluation
      +must(Constraint) ModularRuleset
    }
    class Constraint <<ValueObject>> #D8EBF7
  }
}

package "packs.domain  «CORE»" #F2F9FD {

  ' --- aggregate root ---
  class Pack <<AggregateRoot>> #EAF4FB {
    +id() PackIdentifier
    +descriptor() PackDescriptor
    +tactics() List<Tactic>
    +directives() List<Directive>
    +styleguides() List<Styleguide>
    +paradigms() List<Paradigm>
    +violations() List<PackElementViolation>
  }

  ' --- thin common spine of every artefact ---
  interface CharterArtifact <<Entity>> #EAF4FB {
    +kind() ArtifactKind
    +packId() PackIdentifier
    +localId() String
    +schemaVersion() String
    +label() String
    +description() Optional<String>
    +edges() List<DrgEdge>
    +urn() Urn
  }

  ' --- the four child entities ---
  class Tactic <<Entity>> #EAF4FB {
    +id() TacticIdentifier
  }
  class Directive <<Entity>> #EAF4FB {
    +id() DirectiveIdentifier
    +enforcement() Enforcement
  }
  class Styleguide <<Entity>> #EAF4FB {
    +id() StyleguideIdentifier
    +scope() StyleguideScope
  }
  class Paradigm <<Entity>> #EAF4FB {
    +id() ParadigmIdentifier
  }

  ' --- identity value objects (one per entity kind) ---
  class PackIdentifier <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
  class TacticIdentifier <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
  class DirectiveIdentifier <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
  class StyleguideIdentifier <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
  class ParadigmIdentifier <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB

  ' --- distinctive value objects per artefact ---
  class TacticStep <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
  class TacticReference <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
  class DirectiveReference <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
  class ParadigmReference <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
  class StyleguidePattern <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
  class StyleguideAntiPattern <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
  enum Enforcement <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
  enum StyleguideScope <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
  class PackElementViolation <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB

  ' --- styleguide's nested structural-lint config tree (sealed) ---
  interface ConfigValue <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
  class "ConfigValue.Scalar" as ConfigScalar <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
  class "ConfigValue.Seq" as ConfigSeq <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB
  class "ConfigValue.Mapping" as ConfigMapping <<ValueObject>> #EAF4FB

  ' --- domain ports: one per artefact kind + aggregate assembly ---
  interface TacticRepository <<Repository>> #EAF4FB {
    +save(Tactic) void
    +load(PackIdentifier, TacticIdentifier) Optional<Tactic>
  }
  interface DirectiveRepository <<Repository>> #EAF4FB {
    +save(Directive) void
    +load(PackIdentifier, DirectiveIdentifier) Optional<Directive>
  }
  interface StyleguideRepository <<Repository>> #EAF4FB {
    +save(Styleguide) void
    +load(PackIdentifier, StyleguideIdentifier) Optional<Styleguide>
  }
  interface ParadigmRepository <<Repository>> #EAF4FB {
    +save(Paradigm) void
    +load(PackIdentifier, ParadigmIdentifier) Optional<Paradigm>
  }
  interface PackRepository <<Repository>> #EAF4FB {
    +load(PackIdentifier) Pack
  }
  interface PackDescriptorRepository <<Repository>> #EAF4FB {
    +get(PackIdentifier) PackDescriptor
    +save(PackIdentifier, PackDescriptor) void
  }
}

package "packs.application  «EDGE»" #FDF4EE {
  class TacticReadService <<ApplicationService>> #FBEEE6 {
    +tacticsOf(PackIdentifier) Verified<List<Tactic>>
    +tactic(PackIdentifier, TacticIdentifier) Verified<Tactic>
  }
  class ApplicationConfiguration <<Configuration>> #FBEEE6
}

package "packs.infra.storage  «EDGE»" #FDF4EE {
  class DomainRepositoryService <<Adapter>> #FBEEE6 {
    .. realizes all four artefact ports ..
    +save(Tactic/Directive/Styleguide/Paradigm) void
    +load(PackIdentifier, <id>) Optional<entity>
  }
  interface SerializationStrategy <<Strategy>> #FBEEE6 {
    +writeTactic(TacticDso) / readTactic(..)
    +writeDirective(DirectiveDso) / readDirective(..)
    +writeStyleguide(StyleguideDso) / readStyleguide(..)
    +writeParadigm(ParadigmDso) / readParadigm(..)
  }
  class YamlSerializationStrategy <<Strategy>> #FBEEE6
  class TacticDso <<DSO>> #FBEEE6
  class DirectiveDso <<DSO>> #FBEEE6
  class StyleguideDso <<DSO>> #FBEEE6
  class ParadigmDso <<DSO>> #FBEEE6
}

package "packs.infra.api  «EDGE»" #FDF4EE {
  class TacticController <<Adapter>> #FBEEE6 {
    +getTactic(String pack, String tactic) TacticResponse
  }
}

package "deployable  «Composition Root»" #F3F4F6 {
  class DeployableConfiguration <<CompositionRoot>> #F0F2F4 {
    +main(String[] args) void
  }
}

' --- domain: aggregate containment & multiplicities ---
Pack "1" *-- "1" PackDescriptor : descriptor
Pack "1" *-- "0..*" Tactic : tactics
Pack "1" *-- "0..*" Directive : directives
Pack "1" *-- "0..*" Styleguide : styleguides
Pack "1" *-- "0..*" Paradigm : paradigms
Pack "1" *-- "0..*" PackElementViolation : violations
Pack --> PackIdentifier : identity

' --- every child entity is a CharterArtifact bound to its owning pack ---
Tactic ..|> CharterArtifact
Directive ..|> CharterArtifact
Styleguide ..|> CharterArtifact
Paradigm ..|> CharterArtifact
CharterArtifact ..> PackIdentifier : packId()
CharterArtifact ..> ArtifactKind : kind()

' --- entity identity VOs ---
Tactic --> TacticIdentifier : identity
Directive --> DirectiveIdentifier : identity
Styleguide --> StyleguideIdentifier : identity
Paradigm --> ParadigmIdentifier : identity

' --- distinctive value objects owned by each artefact ---
Tactic "1" *-- "1..*" TacticStep : steps
Tactic "1" *-- "0..*" TacticReference : references
TacticStep "1" o-- "0..*" TacticReference : step refs
Directive "1" *-- "0..*" DirectiveReference : references
Directive --> Enforcement : enforcement
Paradigm "1" *-- "0..*" ParadigmReference : references
Styleguide "1" *-- "0..*" StyleguidePattern : patterns
Styleguide "1" *-- "0..*" StyleguideAntiPattern : antiPatterns
Styleguide --> StyleguideScope : scope
Styleguide "1" *-- "0..1" ConfigValue : structuralLintConfig

' --- ConfigValue sealed tree ---
ConfigValue <|.. ConfigScalar
ConfigValue <|.. ConfigSeq
ConfigValue <|.. ConfigMapping
ConfigSeq *-- "0..*" ConfigValue : items
ConfigMapping *-- "0..*" ConfigValue : entries

' --- ports return domain types only ---
TacticRepository ..> Tactic
DirectiveRepository ..> Directive
StyleguideRepository ..> Styleguide
ParadigmRepository ..> Paradigm
PackRepository ..> Pack : assembles aggregate
PackDescriptorRepository ..> PackDescriptor

' --- invariants enforced through the shared kernel ---
Pack ..> ModularRuleset : guards invariants (every child belongs to this pack; no duplicate child ids)
Tactic ..> ModularRuleset
Directive ..> ModularRuleset
Styleguide ..> ModularRuleset
Paradigm ..> ModularRuleset
ModularRuleset ..> Constraint : evaluates

' --- application edge depends on domain ports (DIP) ---
TacticReadService ..> PackRepository
TacticReadService ..> TacticRepository

' --- storage edge: one adapter realizes ALL four ports; strategy maps every DSO kind ---
DomainRepositoryService ..|> TacticRepository
DomainRepositoryService ..|> DirectiveRepository
DomainRepositoryService ..|> StyleguideRepository
DomainRepositoryService ..|> ParadigmRepository
YamlSerializationStrategy ..|> SerializationStrategy
DomainRepositoryService --> SerializationStrategy : delegates (ctor-injected)
DomainRepositoryService ..> TacticDso
DomainRepositoryService ..> DirectiveDso
DomainRepositoryService ..> StyleguideDso
DomainRepositoryService ..> ParadigmDso
SerializationStrategy ..> TacticDso
SerializationStrategy ..> DirectiveDso
SerializationStrategy ..> StyleguideDso
SerializationStrategy ..> ParadigmDso

' --- web edge -> application edge (Tactic only) ---
TacticController ..> TacticReadService

' --- composition root wires the edges ---
DeployableConfiguration ..> ApplicationConfiguration : imports
DeployableConfiguration ..> DomainRepositoryService : imports StorageConfiguration (scan)
DeployableConfiguration ..> YamlSerializationStrategy : wires strategy
DeployableConfiguration ..> TacticController : imports ApiConfiguration

note bottom of ParadigmDso
  <b>Round-trip fidelity</b> is asserted at the storage edge on the
  value-equal DSO records (one per kind): fetch(write(fetch(x))) == fetch(x)
  — NOT on each entity's identity-based equals.
end note

note "<b>WIRING ASYMMETRY — only Tactic is wired end-to-end.</b>\nTactic: domain entity + TacticRepository + DSO + TacticReadService (application) + TacticController (api).\nDirective / Styleguide / Paradigm: domain entity + identifier VO + repository port + DSO ONLY.\nThey have NO application read service and NO REST controller yet — all three dangle at the storage edge.\nClosing that gap is the next wiring step." as AsymNote #FFF3CD

Directive .. AsymNote
Styleguide .. AsymNote
Paradigm .. AsymNote
AsymNote .. TacticReadService
AsymNote .. TacticController

note bottom of DomainRepositoryService
  Future: a @Repository DB sibling adapter
  is a second impl of the same domain ports.
end note

legend right
  <b>Core vs edge</b>
  Blue = pure core (kernel.domain, kernel.validation, packs.domain)
  Amber = edge rings (application, storage, api)
  Grey = composition root
  Yellow note = not-yet-built wiring (the artefact asymmetry)
  Stereotypes: «AggregateRoot» «Entity» «ValueObject»
  «Repository»(port) «ApplicationService» «Adapter»
  «Strategy» «DSO» «DomainService» «Configuration»
endlegend

@enduml
